msgid "Switch 2 Blocker"
msgstr "Switch 2 联网伪装"

msgid "Nintendo Switch 2: Connection Spoofing and Update Blocking"
msgstr "Nintendo Switch 2 联网伪装与系统更新阻断"

msgid "Use this OpenWrt router as the only gateway for the console. Isolate it from LAN peers and alternate gateways with a dedicated network and client isolation. Disable software and hardware flow offloading and vendor acceleration. A secondary DNS or DHCP server cannot enforce isolation."
msgstr "请将本 OpenWrt 路由器设为主机的唯一网关，并通过专用网络和客户端隔离，禁止主机访问其他局域网设备或备用网关。关闭软件和硬件流量分载以及厂商提供的网络加速功能。仅使用旁路 DNS 或 DHCP 服务器无法实现隔离。"

msgid "Enroll every Wi-Fi and dock/Ethernet adapter MAC, including any randomized address actually used. Traffic that bypasses this router or uses an unlisted address is not blocked."
msgstr "请登记所有 Wi-Fi、底座和有线网卡的 MAC 地址，包括实际使用的随机地址。绕过本路由器或使用未登记地址的流量不会被阻断。"

msgid "Network Isolation"
msgstr "基础网络隔离设置"

msgid "Enable Spoofing and Update Blocking"
msgstr "启用伪装与断网保护"

msgid "If the enabled policy cannot be restored at early boot, normal router network startup is held. Use a local console or failsafe to repair it or explicitly disable isolation. Disabling it removes protection for all enrolled adapters."
msgstr "如果已启用的隔离规则在启动初期无法恢复，路由器会暂停正常的网络启动。请通过本地控制台或故障恢复模式修复配置，或明确关闭隔离。关闭隔离会解除所有已登记网卡的保护。"

msgid "Router LAN IP"
msgstr "路由器主 LAN IP"

msgid "The main dnsmasq and LuCI use this IP. The app detects it from the LAN interface."
msgstr "主 dnsmasq 与后台管理界面监听的 IP 地址（自动探测当前 LAN 口 IP）。"

msgid "Switch Helper IP"
msgstr "Switch 专用伪装辅助 IP"

msgid "Choose an unused IPv4 address in the router LAN subnet, outside the DHCP pool. The helper will bind to it on br-lan."
msgstr "请从本路由器的 LAN 子网中选用一个未被占用且不在 DHCP 地址池内的 IPv4 地址。辅助服务将绑定到 br-lan 上的该地址。"

msgid "The Switch Helper IP must differ from the Router LAN IP."
msgstr "伪装辅助 IP 不能与路由器主 LAN IP 相同！"

msgid "Use a Switch Helper IP in the same /24 subnet as the Router LAN IP, such as %s.254."
msgstr "伪装辅助 IP 必须与主 LAN IP 处于同一 /24 网段（如 %s.254）！"

msgid "Nintendo Connection Test Domain"
msgstr "任天堂联网测试域名"

msgid "Default: ctest.p01.ctest.srv.nintendo.net. Usually no change is needed."
msgstr "默认拦截 ctest.p01.ctest.srv.nintendo.net，通常无需修改。"

msgid "Connection Self-Test"
msgstr "服务连通性自检"

msgid "Click Save & Apply first. The self-test checks the local DNS answer, exact HTTP response, listener and active isolation policy for all enrolled MACs."
msgstr "请先点击「保存并应用」。自检将核对本机 DNS 回答、HTTP 响应的实际内容、监听端口，以及所有已登记 MAC 地址的隔离规则是否生效。"

msgid "Run Self-Test"
msgstr "立即测试伪装服务"

msgid "Enrolled adapters"
msgstr "已登记网卡"

msgid "Add a row for each real adapter. Blocking is required for every row. For a previously unchecked adapter, check its enrollment box or remove its row."
msgstr "每张实际使用的网卡各填一行，每行都必须启用阻断。旧配置中未勾选的网卡，请明确勾选或删除该行。"

msgid "Device Name"
msgstr "设备备注"

msgid "MAC Address"
msgstr "MAC 地址"

msgid "Static IP (Optional)"
msgstr "分配静态 IP (可选)"

msgid "Leave blank for an automatic IP. The device still gets the Switch Helper IP as its DNS server."
msgstr "留空则由路由器自动分配动态 IP，并同样下发专属伪装 DNS。"

msgid "Auto-assign (e.g., %s.x)"
msgstr "留空自动分配 (如 %s.x)"

msgid "Auto-assign"
msgstr "留空自动分配"

msgid "The static IP must differ from the Router LAN IP and the Switch Helper IP."
msgstr "静态 IP 不能与路由器主 IP 或伪装辅助 IP 相同！"

msgid "Use a static IP in the same subnet as the Router LAN IP (%s.x)."
msgstr "静态 IP 必须与路由器主 LAN IP 处于同一网段（%s.x）！"

msgid "Enroll for blocking (required)"
msgstr "登记并启用阻断（必选）"

msgid "Enroll at least one real adapter MAC address before enabling isolation."
msgstr "启用隔离前，请先登记至少一个真实网卡的 MAC 地址。"

msgid "Enter a valid unicast IPv4 address for both the router LAN and the local helper."
msgstr "请分别为主 LAN 接口和本地辅助服务填写有效的单播 IPv4 地址。"

msgid "Enter a real, nonzero unicast MAC address for every adapter."
msgstr "请为每张网卡填写真实、非全零的单播 MAC 地址。"

msgid "Duplicate adapter MAC address: %s"
msgstr "网卡 MAC 地址重复：%s"

msgid "Enroll every listed adapter for blocking or remove its row."
msgstr "请为列表中的每张网卡勾选阻断；若不登记，请删除对应行。"

msgid "Settings are pending, unsaved or no longer match this page. Save & Apply or reload before testing."
msgstr "存在待应用、未保存或与页面显示不一致的配置。请先「保存并应用」，或重新加载页面后再测试。"

msgid "Isolation is disabled."
msgstr "隔离未启用。"

msgid "Running the Self-Test..."
msgstr "正在自检……"

msgid "Checking the router-local helper and active isolation policy."
msgstr "正在检查路由器上的辅助服务和当前生效的隔离规则。"

msgid "Self-Test Results"
msgstr "自检结果"

msgid "Router-local checks passed for the committed adapter list."
msgstr "对已应用网卡列表的路由器本机检查已通过。"

msgid "Isolation or helper checks failed or could not be verified."
msgstr "隔离或辅助服务检查未通过，或无法验证。"

msgid "This is a snapshot on the router, not a test from the console. It cannot verify adapter ownership, peer isolation, hardware bypasses or other networks."
msgstr "这是路由器本机当前的检查结果，并非从游戏主机发起的测试。它无法核实网卡归属、客户端之间的隔离、硬件旁路或其他网络。"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "Could not run the self-test: %s"
msgstr "检测执行失败: %s"

msgid "On the isolated network, test each Wi-Fi and dock adapter from the console. Verify the local connection test works and external IPv4 and IPv6 traffic cannot pass."
msgstr "在隔离网络上，从游戏主机分别测试每个 Wi-Fi 和底座网卡。确认本地连接测试可通过，且外部 IPv4 和 IPv6 流量均无法通行。"
